                                "text": "They do it by absorbing sun rays. (Lo hacen absorbiendo los rayos del Sol)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f46dd337-e4b3-433c-b97a-c95eb3012b3f",
                                "sense_id": "6d0672ef-42ce-321b-94cb-051dee9b4433",
                                "text": "While absorbing the rays, they remain vulnerable. (Mientras absorben los rayos, permanecen vulnerables)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cda76335-5800-45c8-b42c-d397c21ef8c9",
                                "sense_id": "6d0672ef-42ce-321b-94cb-051dee9b4433",
                                "text": "The task of absorbing the rays takes them some time. (La tarea de absorber los rayos les lleva tiempo)."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
